full-query: "You have just recently deployed an application on EC2 instances behind an ELB. After a couple of weeks, customers are complaining about receiving errors from the application. You want to diagnose the errors and are trying to get errors from the ELB access logs. But the ELB access logs are empty. What is the reason for this?"
